{ "Can't init DLSSG Output\nAre you missing the streamline folder?", "Kan DLSSG-output niet initialiseren\nOntbreekt de map streamline?" },
{ "Can't init FSR FG\nAre you missing the required DLLs?", "Kan FSR FG niet initialiseren\nOntbreken de vereiste DLL's?" },
